# The smelter's script. It runs one shift after every delve.
# Every line takes one tick, and the furnace cools by 1 each tick.
stoke()      # burn 1 wood: heat 5
stoke()      # and another: heat 10
smelt()      # needs heat 5 or more: 1 ore becomes 1 iron
smelt()
smelt()
smelt()
# The furnace is cooling down now. With a loop you could keep
# going until the ore runs out, stoking when heat() gets low.
